      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "name": "R intro",
       "content": "The redesign keeps the studio the site already lives in \u2014 warm hardware, signal orange, Syne, mono silkscreen \u2014 and makes the material quieter, the layout more editorial, and the music motif structural.",
